xcell+
}

{: xsearch ( a -( pad fail )- a )
xtraverse& xname_from_token +
pad s= cut }~ nip

{: xfind ( -( pad fail )- a )
xcurrent xsearch xname_from_token }~ -

{: undef ( -( pad emit )- )
pad s. "  undefined" s. cr }~ bye

{: xfind' ( -( pad bye )- a )
' xfind ' undef }~|

